From: Linus Walleij <linusw@kernel.org>
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: protect XG6846B loader and match CFE UBI extent

CFE leaves the last four 128 KiB eraseblocks for the NAND BBT.
Expose the same UBI extent to Linux and prevent writes to the loader.

---
diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm6846-genexis-xg6846b.dts b/arch/arm/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm6846-genexis-xg6846b.dts
index 16e60d6ec73e..1faee854e642 100644
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm6846-genexis-xg6846b.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm6846-genexis-xg6846b.dts
@@ -284,12 +284,13 @@
 		loader@0 {
 			label = "loader";
 			reg = <0x00000000 0x00400000>;
+			read-only;
 		};
 		image@400000 {
 			label = "image";
-			reg = <0x00400000 0x0fb00000>;
+			reg = <0x00400000 0x0fb80000>;
 		};
-		/* 0x00ff0000-0x00ffffff: bad block list */
+		/* 0x0ff80000-0x0fffffff: bad block tables */
 	};
 };
 
